From 61ee07ebbd636a697b5d42dfb5bab5ee80b8e91d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nishil Faldu <faldund@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:32:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(remend): complete links only in the current block

An unclosed `[` or `](` in an earlier paragraph, list item, heading or
table row added `](streamdown:incomplete-link)` to later text, or
dropped everything after it. Link text can't continue past the end of
its block, so remend now completes links and images only in the
current block: the one at the end of the text.
