+---
+"remend": patch
+---
+
+Complete unfinished links and images only in the current block: the paragraph, list item, heading or table row at the end of the text. An unclosed `[` or `](` in an earlier block no longer adds `](streamdown:incomplete-link)` to later text, or drops the text after it.
